Upstream components
-------------------

The vision-language backbone is Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct (Alibaba Cloud), and the
released checkpoint's weights descend from it by way of Xiaomi-Robotics-1. The
adapter loads its processor at runtime through `vlm_processor_path` in
`deploy.yml`.

Qwen source *is* vendored here: `rex_m1/mibot/models/VLM/qwen3vl.py` is the
Qwen3-VL model implementation, generated by HuggingFace Transformers from
`src/transformers/models/qwen3_vl/modular_qwen3_vl.py` and carrying
"Copyright 2025 The Qwen Team and The HuggingFace Inc. team" under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. That header is retained. Rex-M1-preview's changes to this
file are the pooling and no_grad pass described above and carry their own
section 4(b) notice.
